course: dictionary
lesson: 3550
title: A common mineral: feldspar
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: You do not need to know every science word to understand a text. Look at the words around it, because they are its context and often give clues. «Granite is a speckled igneous rock with big crystals of quartz, feldspar and mica, formed deep underground.» Granite is a rock, and feldspar is named with quartz and mica as one of the things inside it, so feldspar must be a mineral found in rock.
explain: «Rocks are made of minerals, natural solid materials» tells you what a mineral is. Feldspar is one of these minerals. Next, read «Feldspar is the most common mineral group in the Earth's crust.» The words most common tell you that feldspar is found a lot in the rocks of the Earth.
explain: Check your meaning by swapping it into the sentence. Try: «Feldspar is the most common group of light-coloured minerals in the Earth's crust.» Does it still make sense? Yes, so your meaning fits. When context is not enough, a science dictionary will settle it.
fact: Feldspar is a very common group of light-coloured minerals found in many rocks.
fact: A mineral is a natural solid material, and feldspar is one kind of mineral.
fact: «Granite» is a speckled rock with big crystals of feldspar, quartz and mica.
fact: Feldspar is often pink, white or grey.
fact: Feldspar is used to make glass and pottery glaze.
exercise: «Granite is a speckled igneous rock with big crystals of quartz, feldspar and mica.» What is feldspar? | A sort of metal used for cars | A type of plant that grows on hills | *A light-coloured mineral found in many rocks | A kind of liquid that flows underground
exercise: «Feldspar is the most common mineral group in the Earth's crust.» What does this tell us? | Feldspar is rare and very hard to find | *Feldspar is found a lot in the rocks of the Earth | Feldspar is only found in the sky | Feldspar is found only in the sea
exercise: «Feldspar is often pink, white or grey.» Find and copy one colour word from that sentence. | crust | glaze | *white | mineral
test: Feldspar is used to make what? | *Glass and pottery glaze | Bread and cakes | Paper and ink | Wool for jumpers
test: Which other mineral is named with feldspar in the sentence about granite? | *Mica | Gold | Chalk | Iron
exam: You meet the word feldspar in a science text and you are not sure what it means. What should you do first? | *Read the words around it for clues | Skip the whole page and never come back | Stop reading the text for ever | Guess that it is a plant
